{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BMugfUxWEYrQcadjMZRPsT","type":"tool_result","content":"The file C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\noss-to-wim\\bev-diagnostic-rectification\\C05\\KK-01.md has been updated successfully."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"34b7e541-fc46-443f-9329-800f1caa525b","uuid":"4d7662fc-b616-4194-b251-abdb215af70b","timestamp":"2026-04-16T16:21:56.883Z","tool_use_result":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\noss-to-wim\\bev-diagnostic-rectification\\C05\\KK-01.md","oldString":"## Assessment Checklist\n| Criteria | C | NYC |\n|----------|---|-----|\n| Briefing prepared with agenda covering all required items | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Briefing delivered clearly within 15-20 minutes | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Attendance list circulated and signed | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Job allocation matched to technician skill level | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Questions handled and feedback recorded | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Job control board updated | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Clear, confident communication demonstrated | [ ] | [ ] |","newString":"## Assessment Checklist\n| Criteria | C | NYC |\n|----------|---|-----|\n| Briefing prepared with agenda covering all required items | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Briefing delivered clearly within 15-20 minutes | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Attendance list circulated and signed | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Job allocation matched to technician skill level | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Questions handled and feedback recorded | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Job control board updated | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Clear, confident communication demonstrated | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Leadership style appropriate to team situation demonstrated | [ ] | [ ] |\n| All team members given opportunity to contribute/raise concerns | [ ] | [ ] |","originalFile":"# KERTAS KERJA / WORK SHEET\n\n**Kod WIM / WIM Code:** G452-010-3:2023-C05/KK(1/4)\n**Kertas Warna / Paper Color:** BIRU / BLUE\n\n## Work Activity 1: Conduct BEV Daily Briefing\n\n## Objektif Prestasi\n1. Prepare daily briefing information and assignments\n2. Execute a daily briefing session\n3. Record daily briefing feedback and update the job control board\n\n## Materials\n- Briefing agenda template, attendance list form, job control board (whiteboard), sample work orders/job cards, marker pens\n\n## Prosedur Kerja\n\n### Step 1: Prepare Briefing\n1.1 Review previous day's job status on job control board\n1.2 Identify new vehicles received / scheduled for today\n1.3 Allocate tasks to technicians based on skill level and workload\n1.4 Prepare safety topic of the day\n1.5 Gather any service information updates (TSBs, recalls)\n1.6 Write briefing agenda\n\n### Step 2: Execute Briefing\n2.1 Gather all technicians at briefing area\n2.2 Circulate attendance list — all sign\n2.3 Deliver briefing following prepared agenda:\n   - Safety reminder (HV safety topic)\n   - Work progress update from yesterday\n   - New assignments — distribute job cards\n   - Service information updates\n   - Housekeeping / 5S compliance\n2.4 Invite questions and feedback\n2.5 Address concerns raised\n2.6 Close briefing — team disperses to assignments\n\n### Step 3: Post-Briefing Actions\n3.1 Update job control board with today's assignments\n3.2 File attendance list and briefing notes\n3.3 Document any safety concerns raised — initiate follow-up action\n3.4 Monitor work progress during the day\n\n## Assessment Checklist\n| Criteria | C | NYC |\n|----------|---|-----|\n| Briefing prepared with agenda covering all required items | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Briefing delivered clearly within 15-20 minutes | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Attendance list circulated and signed | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Job allocation matched to technician skill level | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Questions handled and feedback recorded | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Job control board updated | [ ] | [ ] |\n| Clear, confident communication demonstrated | [ ] | [ ] |\n\n**Trainee:** _______________ **Instructor:** _______________ **Date:** _______________\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":52,"oldLines":5,"newStart":52,"newLines":7,"lines":[" | Questions handled and feedback recorded | [ ] | [ ] |"," | Job control board updated | [ ] | [ ] |"," | Clear, confident communication demonstrated | [ ] | [ ] |","+| Leadership style appropriate to team situation demonstrated | [ ] | [ ] |","+| All team members given opportunity to contribute/raise concerns | [ ] | [ ] |"," "," **Trainee:** _______________ **Instructor:** _______________ **Date:** _______________"]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false}}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01VaBnJiU3444z7AFAS6ZDXN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QssAwkDZG7qLNLjMd4HCUS","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\noss-to-wim\\bev-diagnostic-rectification\\C05\\KK-02.md","old_string":"### Step 3: Identify Improvement Actions\n3.1 For areas rated below standard:\n   - Determine appropriate improvement technique (OJT, refresher, counselling, mentoring)\n   - If training needed: complete training nomination form\n   - If counselling needed: prepare counselling session agenda\n3.2 For top-performing areas: note recognition recommendations","new_string":"### Step 3: Identify Improvement Actions\n3.1 For areas rated below standard:\n   - Determine appropriate improvement technique (OJT, refresher, counselling, mentoring)\n   - If training needed: complete training nomination form\n   - If counselling needed: prepare counselling session agenda\n3.2 For top-performing areas: note recognition recommendations\n3.3 For each improvement action, set a SMART target:\n   - Define the specific behaviour/skill to improve (Specific)\n   - State the measurable standard to be achieved (Measurable)\n   - Confirm the target is achievable with available resources (Achievable)\n   - Link the target directly to the technician's job role (Relevant)\n   - Set a review date (Time-bound)\n   - Document the SMART target in the counselling form"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":518,"cache_read_input_tokens":51920,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":518},"output_tokens":63,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"34b7e541-fc46-443f-9329-800f1caa525b","uuid":"7d85fcbd-4867-4dfc-9567-c0